# Claude Code working dir (AGENTS.md: never stage)
.claude/

# Hospital-provided mock export. Keep outside Git until its synthetic/
# desensitized status has been reviewed; tests use the committed fixture CSV.
# The export the hospital sent uses U+2011 (non-breaking hyphen) in the
# filename, which an ASCII-hyphen pattern does NOT match (the U+2011 lead byte
# differs from '-'). A single "moke*" glob covers the ASCII-hyphen variant, the
# U+2011 variant, and the output of apps/worker's mock:convert entry alike - all
# contain likely-real patient data and must never be staged (issue #42).
Doc/moke*

# Raw SOAP gateway captures (real patient data via curl/SoapUI against the
# hospital's DHC/Ensemble EnsWebService) - never stage, same as Doc/moke*.
tmp.md
/tmp.*.md
